      "title": "LIVEN Bass & Beats MIDI implementation chart (r1)",
      "notes": "MIDI implementation chart read by tools/profiles/sonicware/read-sonicware-chart.mjs from bassandbeats_manual_MIDI_en_r1.pdf (sha256 2ea2be05330a5eda64eaf3a26ffe7f83329a92a6238f4d8ec16d173e7b059117), https://www.sonicware.co.jp/DL/LIVEN_BB/DOC/bassandbeats_manual_MIDI_en_r1.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/sonicware/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/sonicware/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a control change the chart marks recognized, its name the chart's remark, sent on the channel of its block. The chart prints no values: each is 0 - 127. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart puts the pattern's controllers on the pattern channel (PT.CH) and the track ones on the bass's or the drums' (BA.CH, DR.CH); a track controller names what it does on each (`MEMORY / LEVEL KICK`), the second for the drum track."
  ],
